<title>GERMANY: Krupp - steel talks with Thyssen progressing.</title>
<headline>Krupp - steel talks with Thyssen progressing.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talks between Germany's Krupp steel group and Thyssen AG on the merger of their steel operations are progressing satisfactorily, Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp chairman Gerhard Cromme said on Friday.</p>
<p>Krupp's sales and orders were up five to seven percent in the first half of the year, Cromme told the company's annual general meeting, according to the prepared text of his speech.</p>
</text>
